  "boundaries": [
    "The local journal record is not a quorum receipt or permission to dispatch. No public runtime, push, workflow or cloud change.",
    "Immutable quorum intent/selection propagation, automatic observation/consolidation, cross-view pending-context integration and complete 3B-3E remain open.",
    "Independent replay reconstructs original bootstrap and fourteen local retention transactions. The separate native publication history is asserted in Java, without a new full protocol replay claim.",
    "Qualified and codec-final builds have identical production Java. The latter adds all-seven-profile codec assertions only. Earlier failures and the initial-source recovery regression remain distinct.",
    "No power-loss claim. Candidates are disposable only because no dispatch can precede active replacement and parent force; active ambiguity survives restart."
